# Real build artifacts -- never commit these. CI builds them fresh and attaches the .deb to
# GitHub Releases; a compiled binary or .deb sitting in source control only bloats the repo
# permanently for no real benefit.
claudia-mcp-server
*.deb
claudia-mcp-server_*/

# Real local dev config -- may contain real secrets once filled in. test-etc/config.json is
# deliberately not committed even though the example file (checked into packaging/) is safe;
# a developer's own filled-in local copy should never accidentally get pushed.
test-etc/config.json
